/* The FUSB302B (usb_pd) is a PD PHY ONLY -- it does not negotiate by  */
/* itself.  Reaching the higher-voltage USB-C contract (so +VIN rises  */
/* from the 5 V default to the negotiated voltage) requires the SC to  */
/* run PD policy through the FUSB302B over I2C (BRINGUP.md Stage 1).   */
/* These are the ENTRY POINTS a PD stack (e.g. the Zephyr USB-C        */
/* subsystem or a vendored tcpm) plugs into; the protocol itself is    */
/* out of scope for this scaffold -- the hooks make the integration    */
/* point explicit and netlist-anchored (address from the contract).    */

